# {{.Name}}

A [Gochin](https://github.com/sachinkaru123/gochin) application.

## Setup

```bash
cp .env.example .env      # then edit your database credentials
createdb {{.Name}}_db

go run . db migrate       # create the tables
go run . db seed          # add development data
go run . run start        # http://localhost:8080
```

## Try it

```bash
curl localhost:8080/health

curl -X POST localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login \
  -d '{"email":"ada@gochin.test","password":"password123456"}'
```

## Add something new

```bash
go run . make controller Post --resource
go run . make service Post
go run . make model Post
go run . make migration create_posts_table --table=posts

go run . route list
```

See the [Gochin README](https://github.com/sachinkaru123/gochin) for the full
guide: routing, the ORM and relationships, authentication, middleware,
logging, file uploads and mail.
